WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.107
This is a recording of the running app with fictional training records.

5
00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:06.252
Cloud responses and G P S are simulated.

9
00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:08.879
Sign in using your company username and password.

13
00:00:08.879 --> 00:00:10.274
Never share your password.

17
00:00:11.074 --> 00:00:13.046
N P I oversees every subcontractor.

21
00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:16.935
Check active work, company reviews and work waiting for verification.

25
00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:22.572
Start by setting up the company, locations, services and contract before inviting its administrator.

29
00:00:23.372 --> 00:00:25.400
Open Companies and choose Add company.

33
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.908
Enter the subcontractor business name and save.

37
00:00:27.908 --> 00:00:29.670
Repeat for future subcontractors.

41
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.232
You do not need to create their worker accounts.

45
00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.719
Open Locations and Add location.

49
00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:37.356
Enter the site name and a verified street address.

53
00:00:37.356 --> 00:00:39.993
Select the matching bundled photograph, then save.

57
00:00:39.993 --> 00:00:44.371
Site pictures identify the building; they are not evidence that work was completed.

61
00:00:45.171 --> 00:00:50.792
In Settings, use Add service to define the work your companies can assign, such as snow clearing or hauling.

65
00:00:50.792 --> 00:00:52.613
Enter a clear name and description.

69
00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:55.892
Billing and prices are deliberately excluded from this release.

73
00:00:56.692 --> 00:01:00.822
Open Contracts and add the contract name, customer and optional reference.

77
00:01:00.822 --> 00:01:02.943
These details organise responsibility.

81
00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:07.687
Do not enter confidential contract documents or prices into these descriptive fields.

85
00:01:08.487 --> 00:01:10.406
Choose Assign site to subcontractor.

89
00:01:10.406 --> 00:01:12.645
Select the contract, company and location.

93
00:01:12.645 --> 00:01:14.350
Save each permitted combination.

97
00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.921
These assignments control where a company may schedule its workers.

101
00:01:18.721 --> 00:01:22.230
Open People and access and invite a subcontractor administrator.

105
00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.970
Select the company and create its invitation link.

109
00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:26.341
Share the link privately.

113
00:01:26.341 --> 00:01:28.862
It is single use and expires after seven days.

117
00:01:28.862 --> 00:01:31.494
The administrator chooses their own credentials.

121
00:01:32.294 --> 00:01:33.833
Review the account register.

125
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:37.463
The company administrator approves their own worker registrations.

129
00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:41.697
N P I can oversee accounts, reset company access or pause access when needed.

133
00:01:41.697 --> 00:01:44.282
Pausing access preserves original work records.

137
00:01:45.082 --> 00:01:47.011
Open a work order waiting for N P I.

141
00:01:47.011 --> 00:01:49.368
Compare recorded time with the worker claim.

145
00:01:49.368 --> 00:01:51.672
Read both check in and checkout timestamps.

149
00:01:51.672 --> 00:01:54.834
Each location link opens the captured coordinates on a map.

153
00:01:54.834 --> 00:01:57.245
Check accuracy and the assigned site address.

157
00:01:58.045 --> 00:02:00.697
Check completed tasks and open uploaded evidence.

161
00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:03.456
Choose Verify and accept hours only when satisfied.

165
00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.487
Keep exact claimed time, or explain a manual adjustment.

169
00:02:06.487 --> 00:02:11.682
To return a record, close this form and choose Return to company with a clear correction reason.

173
00:02:12.482 --> 00:02:15.215
Spreadsheet review shows proposed management changes.

177
00:02:15.215 --> 00:02:18.258
Check the values and version before accepting or rejecting.

181
00:02:18.258 --> 00:02:20.218
Original attendance remains protected.

185
00:02:20.218 --> 00:02:24.550
The spreadsheet is a management table view; it is not the same interface as the app.

189
00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:29.103
Check the overview, review submitted work, and refresh after changes.

193
00:02:29.103 --> 00:02:32.149
Repeat company and site setup for future subcontractors.

197
00:02:32.149 --> 00:02:34.597
All working times use the Anchorage timezone.

201
00:02:34.597 --> 00:02:36.882
Sign out when finished on a shared device.
